            </note>
            <note corresp="#d304-f2" n="6" xml:id="d304-f2-content">
                <p>For text of SCAP’s proclamation of January 19 on the International Military
                    Tribunal for the Far East and its charter, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, March 10, 1946, p. 361.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
